ing or Receipt Accounting, and transactions created after the pending-close date will not be processed until the period is closed or reopened. Transactions entered before the pending-close date continue to process. Revenue lines, COGS recognition, and manual cost adjustments are exceptions and continue to process. The event type and status are unavailable, so no event-specific consistency finding is justified.\\\",\\n    \\\"calculation_required\\\": \\\"late_minutes = (event_created_time - 2025-09-30T18:00:00) in seconds / 60; not calculated because the event-created time is unavailable.\\\",\\n    \\\"read_only_review\\\": true\\n  },\\n  \\\"provenance\\\": {\\n    \\\"source_snapshot_id\\\": \\\"r_beaaa9e2462eb3e206e8448d\\\",\\n    \\\"source_ids\\\": [\\\"r_3116e6c608f711c5b5e90b91\\\"],\\n    \\\"source_resource_version\\\": 1,\\n    \\\"source_payload_sha256\\\": \\\"77129c2275b1708302c90753b4f186a1e6de5e3649f76593bbda72f103869027\\\",\\n    \\\"business_source_file\\\": \\\"system/oracle_scm_cost_management/state.db\\\",\\n    \\\"document\\\": {\\n      \\\"source_file\\\": \\\"workspace/02_Cost_Accounting/oracle_supply_chain_cost_management_26b.pdf\\\",\\n      \\\"section\\\": \\\"Cost Accounting Period Statuses and Transaction Accounting\\\",\\n      \\\"pdf_page\\\": 233,\\n      \\\"printed_page\\\": 225\\n    },\\n    \\\"own_read_receipt_resource_id\\\": \\\"r_14721958559481dc3bcf9b54\\\",\\n    \\\"own_read_receipt_path\\\": \\\"/cache/work/worker_beb79fe73815/reads/r_14721958559481dc3bcf9b54.json\\\",\\n    \\\"services_used\\\": [\\n      \\\"service_describe: assignment, schema, and workflow\\\",\\n      \\\"resource_list: accessible public source and not-staged protected source metadata\\\",\\n      \\\"resource_read: successful read of Task records\\\",\\n      \\\"data_query: group_count by table, exact work-order lookup, exact cost-period lookup, and zero accessible cost-event count\\\",\\n      \\\"resource_read: Supporting records returned